Granting Read-Only Access to a New commer in Developer Team : 
========READ ANY TABLE vs. SELECT ANY TABLE========

A new member joined the developer team and needed read-only access to the database.

I searched for existing read-only roles using the Roles section of the Schema Browser in **Toad**. Two similar roles came up:

Role	                      System privilege granted
READONLYROLE	                   READ ANY TABLE
READ_ONLY_ROLE	                SELECT ANY TABLE

Another way to find this (without Toad):
-- Find candidate roles
SELECT role FROM dba_roles WHERE UPPER(role) LIKE '%READ%';

-- See which system privileges each role contains
SELECT role, privilege
FROM   role_sys_privs
WHERE  role IN ('READONLYROLE', 'READ_ONLY_ROLE');

-- See which users already have these roles
SELECT grantee, granted_role
FROM   dba_role_privs
WHERE  granted_role IN ('READONLYROLE', 'READ_ONLY_ROLE');

